{"ticker":"O","updated":"2026-11-14T01:18:12Z","profile":{"longName":"Realty Income Corporation","shortName":"Realty Income Corporation","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Retail","country":"United States","website":"https://www.realtyincome.com","fullTimeEmployees":544,"marketCap":56095387648,"trailingPE":40.28767,"forwardPE":37.87459,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":9.023794,"pegRatio":2.99,"targetMeanPrice":63.53571,"targetHighPrice":74.0,"targetLowPrice":59.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.102,"earningsGrowth":0.238,"grossMargins":0.92603993,"operatingMargins":0.46783,"profitMargins":0.21809,"totalRevenue":6216386048,"beta":0.649,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":67.94,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":53.15,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":5.55},"summary":"Realty Income Corporation, an S&P 500 company, is real estate partner to the world's leading companies. Founded in 1969, they serve their clients as a full-service real estate capital provider. As of June 30, 2026, they have a portfolio of over 15,500 properties in all 50 U.S. states, the U.K., and eight other countries in Europe. They are known as (The Monthly Dividend Company) and have a mission to invest in people and places to deliver dependable monthly dividends that increase over time. Since their founding, they have declared 676 consecutive monthly dividends and are a member of the S&P 500 Dividend Aristocrats index for having increased dividend for over 31 consecutive years. Realty Income Corporation was founded in 1969 and was incorporated in Maryland.","summary_zh":"Realty Income Corporation 是標準普爾 500 強公司之一，也是世界領先公司的房地產合作夥伴。他們成立於 1969 年，作為全方位服務的房地產資本提供者為客戶提供服務。截至 2026 年 6 月 30 日，他們在美國所有 50 個州、英國和歐洲其他 8 個國家擁有超過 15,500 處房產。他們被稱為（每月股息公司），其使命是投資於人和地方，以提供可靠的每月股息，並隨著時間的推移而增加。自成立以來，他們已連續 676 次每月派息，並因連續 31 年以上增加股息而成為標準普爾 500 紅利貴族指數的成員。 Realty Income Corporation 成立於 1969 年，在馬裡蘭州註冊成立。","sector_zh":"房地產","industry_zh":"房地產投資信託基金 - 零售","candles":[{"t":"2025